      "line": 1,
      "text": "Why the phone leaves the bedroom"
    },
    {
      "id": "D1-S1-P2",
      "draft": "D1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Focus is not a character trait. It is a room."
    },
    {
      "id": "D1-S2-P1",
      "draft": "D1",
      "kind": "heading",
      "line": 5,
      "text": "The eight-second claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "D1-S2-P2",
      "draft": "D1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Popular talks repeat that average focus lasts 8 seconds [1]."
    },
    {
      "id": "D1-S3-P1",
      "draft": "D1",
      "kind": "heading",
      "line": 9,
      "text": "A working change"
    },
    {
      "id": "D1-S3-P2",
      "draft": "D1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "line": 11,
      "text": "A client moved the phone charger to the kitchen. The first week they woke without opening a feed."
    },
    {
      "id": "D1-S3-P3",
      "draft": "D1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "line": 13,
      "text": "[1]: Example Study, 2019, p. 4."
    },
    {
      "id": "D2-S1-P1",
      "draft": "D2",
      "kind": "heading",
      "line": 1,
      "text": "Attention is an environment"
    },
    {
      "id": "D2-S2-P1",
      "draft": "D2",
      "kind": "heading",
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Willpower is the wrong lever"
    },
    {
      "id": "D2-S2-P2",
      "draft": "D2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Environment design beats willpower. Put the charger where the morning does not start with a screen."
    },
    {
      "id": "D2-S3-P1",
      "draft": "D2",
      "kind": "heading",
      "line": 7,
      "text": "The eight-second claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "D2-S3-P2",
      "draft": "D2",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Average focus lasts 8 seconds. That number is a staging device, not a diagnosis."
    },
    {
      "id": "D3-S1-P1",
      "draft": "D3",
